0:32.119">I've </span><span begin="00:32.119" end="00:32.495">been </span><span begin="00:32.495" end="00:32.775">so </span><span begin="00:32.775" end="00:33.130">cold </span><span begin="00:33.130" end="00:33.408">to </span><span begin="00:33.408" end="00:33.585">the </span><span begin="00:33.585" end="00:33.960">ones </span><span begin="00:33.960" end="00:34.184">who </span><span begin="00:34.184" end="00:34.419">loved </span><span begin="00:34.419" end="00:34.793">me </span><span begin="00:34.793" end="00:36.152">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.104" end="00:40.785"><span begin="00:37.104" end="00:37.336">I </span><span begin="00:37.336" end="00:37.633">look </span><span begin="00:37.633" end="00:37.951">back </span><span begin="00:37.951" end="00:38.275">now </span><span begin="00:38.275" end="00:38.747">and </span><span begin="00:38.747" end="00:40.785">realize</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.321" end="00:46.081"><span begin="00:41.321" end="00:43.355">I </span><span begin="00:43.650" end="00:44.354">remember </span><span begin="00:44.354" end="00:44.682">when </span><span begin="00:44.682" end="00:45.041">I </span><span begin="00:45.041" end="00:45.410">held </span><span begin="00:45.410" end="00:46.081">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.770" end="00:52.161"><span begin="00:47.770" end="00:47.929">You </span><span begin="00:47.929" end="00:48.096">begged </span><span begin="00:48.096" end="00:48.353">me </span><span begin="00:48.353" end="00:48.585">with </span><span begin="00:48.585" end="00:49.122">your </span><span begin="00:49.122" end="00:50.036">drowning </span><span begin="00:50.036" end="00:50.746">eyes </span><span begin="00:50.746" end="00:51.045">to </span><span begin="00:51.045" end="00:52.161">stay</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.626" end="00:56.243"><span begin="00:52.626" end="00:52.947">And </span><span begin="00:52.947" end="00:53.891">I </span><span begin="00:53.891" end="00:54.411">regret </span><sp